Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: picompose-driver-respeaker-lite
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 wireplumber,
 alsa-utils,
 sox,
 libsox-fmt-alsa,
 pipewire-bin
Provides: picompose-audio-driver
Conflicts: picompose-audio-driver
Replaces: picompose-audio-driver
Description: PiCompose audio setup for the ReSpeaker Lite
 Keeps the sound card of the ReSpeaker Lite awake by playing silence, and
 sets the volume of the default sound card and its PipeWire sink to the
 maximum when the system starts. The ReSpeaker Lite needs no driver.
 .
 The package provides picompose-audio-driver, so only one audio driver package
 can be installed.
